OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start but some light
OL,6,Frain or showers developing by late
OL,7,Fmorning, a few showers turning heavy
OL,8,Fand thundery especially over Angus,
OL,9,Fthese could be slow to move away with
OL,10,Fvery light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavier showers dying out but
OL,13,Fshowers through the evening, mostly
OL,14,Fdying out later in the night feeling
OL,15,Fcooler with freshening northerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FQuite breezy and feeling
OL,18,Ffresher with some showers, these
OL,19,Fmostly light and moving away quite
OL,20,Fbriskly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
